WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.266
We have a

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.201
new report tonight

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.402
from the Dossier Center.

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.470
It's an investigative group

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:04.771
that tracks criminal activity

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:05.939
associated with the Kremlin.

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:06.639
It says that since

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:08.074
the start of the invasion, Vladimir

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:09.843
Putin has, for the most part, stopped

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.011
using his private airplane.

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:13.113
Now, this is his preferred mode

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:14.114
of transportation,

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:15.348
according to the dossier group,

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:16.383
which is run by Mikhail

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:18.318
Khodorkovsky, an opposition leader.

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:19.019
Putin is traveling

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:21.021
mostly in this armored train, equipped

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:22.989
with a special communication system.

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:24.524
The psychological reason

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:27.360
of using this train is that he's scared.

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:30.397
He's scared that he can be tracked, that

00:00:30.397 --> 00:00:31.898
his plane can be tracked,

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:33.900
that his plane can be shot down.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.302
He believes that it is a more secure way

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:37.270
to travel,

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:39.939
that nobody will know where he is going,

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:41.074
and nobody will understand that

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:42.342
he's inside history.

